{"id":"64b2699c861a34d7","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-branchingscore.md","title":"Weighted literal scores for branching","display":"df-branchingscore — Weighted literal scores for branching","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-branchingscore","aliases":["27-df-branchingscore"],"display":"df-branchingscore — Weighted literal scores for branching","depends_on":[],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§2.5.1; equation (2.10)","source_printed_pages":"82,83","source_pdf_pages":"106,107","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-branchingscore"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-branchingscore</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-branchingscore — Weighted literal scores for branching"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.5.1; equation (2.10)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"82,83"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"106,107"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\ge1\">\\(n,m\\ge1\\)</span> 为整数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1,\\ldots,L_m\">\\(L_1,\\ldots,L_m\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}\">\\([n]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 的非空子集；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_k\">\\(L_k\\)</span> 不同时含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,0)\">\\((i,0)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,1)\">\\((i,1)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=(w_1,\\ldots,w_n)\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^n\">\\(w=(w_1,\\ldots,w_n)\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^n\\)</span>。文字评分的输入域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}\">\\([n]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JW}\">\\(\\mathrm{JW}\\)</span> 为固定评分标识；计数、评分与候选集由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\coloneqq(L_1,\\ldots,L_m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\coloneqq(L_1,\\ldots,L_m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_{L,d}(\\ell)\\coloneqq|\\{k\\in[m]\\mid|L_k|=d\\land\\ell\\in L_k\\}|\\quad(d\\in[n],\\ \\ell\\in[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_{L,d}(\\ell)\\coloneqq|\\{k\\in[m]\\mid|L_k|=d\\land\\ell\\in L_k\\}|\\quad(d\\in[n],\\ \\ell\\in[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_{L,w}(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\sum_{d=1}^n w_d h_{L,d}(\\ell),\\qquad W_{L,\\mathrm{JW}}(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\sum_{k\\in[m]:\\,\\ell\\in L_k}2^{-|L_k|}\\quad(\\ell\\in[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_{L,w}(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\sum_{d=1}^n w_d h_{L,d}(\\ell),\\qquad W_{L,\\mathrm{JW}}(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\sum_{k\\in[m]:\\,\\ell\\in L_k}2^{-|L_k|}\\quad(\\ell\\in[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Choice}_{L,\\mathrm{JW}}\\coloneqq\\{\\ell\\in\\bigcup_{k=1}^m L_k\\mid\\forall u\\in\\bigcup_{k=1}^m L_k\\;W_{L,\\mathrm{JW}}(u)\\le W_{L,\\mathrm{JW}}(\\ell)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Choice}_{L,\\mathrm{JW}}\\coloneqq\\{\\ell\\in\\bigcup_{k=1}^m L_k\\mid\\forall u\\in\\bigcup_{k=1}^m L_k\\;W_{L,\\mathrm{JW}}(u)\\le W_{L,\\mathrm{JW}}(\\ell)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Jeroslow–Wang 分支评分的形式接口：短项通过 2 的负次数得到更高权重。argmax 返回全部并列候选，因而没有隐含的任意选取；实现可以再按固定文字序打破平局。评分只是一条启发式选择规则，本页不声称它给出最优搜索树或普遍加速保证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"L_1,\\ldots,L_m","display":false},{"tex":"[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L_k","display":false},{"tex":"(i,0)","display":false},{"tex":"(i,1)","display":false},{"tex":"w=(w_1,\\ldots,w_n)\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^n","display":false},{"tex":"[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JW}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\coloneqq(L_1,\\ldots,L_m).","display":true},{"tex":"h_{L,d}(\\ell)\\coloneqq|\\{k\\in[m]\\mid|L_k|=d\\land\\ell\\in L_k\\}|\\quad(d\\in[n],\\ \\ell\\in[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"W_{L,w}(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\sum_{d=1}^n w_d h_{L,d}(\\ell),\\qquad W_{L,\\mathrm{JW}}(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\sum_{k\\in[m]:\\,\\ell\\in L_k}2^{-|L_k|}\\quad(\\ell\\in[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Choice}_{L,\\mathrm{JW}}\\coloneqq\\{\\ell\\in\\bigcup_{k=1}^m L_k\\mid\\forall u\\in\\bigcup_{k=1}^m L_k\\;W_{L,\\mathrm{JW}}(u)\\le W_{L,\\mathrm{JW}}(\\ell)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1929,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-branchingscore|df-branchingscore — Weighted literal scores for branching]]"}],"outgoing":[]}